#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:5 e39ec4b0d40143da9ad8b1f761101af0
msgid "Follow Me Mode (GCS Enabled)"
msgstr "跟随我模式（地面站启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:7 ffbaf7f87a8b4311afd270ab8ab63907
msgid ""
"Follow Me mode makes it possible for you to have your copter follow you as "
"you move, using a telemetry radio and a ground station."
msgstr "跟随我模式可让飞机跟随您移动，使用数传电台和地面站即可实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:12 af594086fea84f8fb80d25e7750a869c
msgid ""
"Unlike other autopilot modes, this feature is implemented in the Ground "
"Station. The ground station controls the movement by reading the vehicle "
"position using MAVLink Telemetry and sending GUIDED mode instructions to "
"move the vehicle appropriately. Currently this sort of functionality is "
"supported by *Mission Planner* for Windows laptops, APM Planner for OS X "
"laptops, and DroidPlanner for Android devices."
msgstr ""
"与其他飞控模式不同，此功能在地面站中实现。地面站通过 MAVLink 数传读取飞行器位置，并发送 Guided "
"模式指令使飞行器跟随移动。目前支持此类功能的地面站包括：Windows 笔记本上的 *Mission Planner*、macOS 笔记本上的 APM "
"Planner，以及 Android 设备上的 DroidPlanner。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:20 c1fb5c3d480d4b9ebd07ef1e633aebc9
msgid "What you'll need"
msgstr "所需设备"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:22 60f71de5cd7242cd8052cc902d74b04d
msgid "A Copter with telemetry"
msgstr "配备数传的飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:23 e567e051d5454706b863ffe139da9ca8
msgid ""
"A laptop (or a phone/tablet with an integrated GPS available to the GCS app)"
msgstr "一台笔记本电脑（或具有内置 GPS 且可供地面站应用访问的手机/平板电脑）"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:24 b7201bbf45924018beadfbe1b772c7b3
msgid ""
"A GPS USB dongle `like this <https://www.amazon.com/ND-100S-GlobalSat-USB-"
"GPS-Receiver/dp/B004K39QTY/>`__ or Bluetooth GPS module `like this "
"<https://www.amazon.com/GlobalSat-BT-368i-Bluetooth-GPS-"
"Receiver/dp/B0018YZ836/>`__."
msgstr ""
"GPS USB 接收机（`如此款 <https://www.amazon.com/ND-100S-GlobalSat-USB-GPS-"
"Receiver/dp/B004K39QTY/>`__）或蓝牙 GPS 模块（`如此款 "
"<https://www.amazon.com/GlobalSat-BT-368i-Bluetooth-GPS-"
"Receiver/dp/B0018YZ836/>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:28 51e123b6ecf447e2b77ddac59e9bfcb5
msgid "Instructions for Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner 操作说明"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:30 3d484f7ec9a444c8a777148ff6a61a4b
msgid "Set one of your flight modes to \"Loiter\""
msgstr "将某个飞行模式设置为\"Loiter\""

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:31 09875236d3584aa88ec5f530b63d330d
msgid ""
"Set up your Copter and establish a MAVLink connection over wireless "
"telemetry"
msgstr "设置好飞机并通过无线数传建立 MAVLink 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:33 4ccb632fdf13429aa4ab641db17dbfc3
msgid ""
"Ensure that your GPS USB dongle or Bluetooth device is plugged into to your "
"laptop and showing up as a serial port. Using the software that came with "
"the module, make sure that it's working and that you have GPS lock."
msgstr "确保 GPS USB 接收器或蓝牙设备已连接至笔记本并识别为串口。使用模块自带软件确认其正常工作且已获得 GPS 锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:37 3807a42343d7441ebb018cd7c915a475
msgid ""
"Take off, and once in the air switch to Loiter. (Make sure there's "
"sufficient altitude to ensure the drone does not injure you)."
msgstr "起飞后切换到 Loiter 模式。（请确保有足够高度，以免飞机伤人。）"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:39 b854be21e3534ef19f47664c4e4d6bd5
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner Flight Data screen try right-clicking on a nearby spot "
"and select \"Fly to Here\". If this works, you're ready to try Follow Me "
"mode."
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面，右键单击附近某个位置并选择\"Fly to Here\"，若成功则可尝试跟随我模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:42 4e6c92ec00af47b7b7412bad11a0df78
msgid ""
"In Mission Planner, enter Control-F to open the following window. Click on "
"\"Follow Me\""
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中按 Ctrl+F 打开如下窗口，点击\"Follow Me\""

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:48 b59a2283a57a47b19d2d3e85582501d6
msgid ""
"This will bring up this window. Select the serial port that's assigned to "
"your GPS device and the baud rate it uses."
msgstr "将弹出此窗口。选择分配给 GPS 设备的串口及其波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:53 59f9126508ca490fae8ea35607986a94
msgid ""
"Once you click \"Connect\", Mission Planner will read GPS data from your "
"device and send it to your Copter as \"fly to here\" commands every two "
"seconds."
msgstr "点击\"Connect\"后，Mission Planner 将读取设备的 GPS 数据并每隔两秒向飞机发送\"fly to here\"指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:57 e1fa493d21004c08954920d9e0d5f93e
msgid "Now pick up your laptop and start walking around."
msgstr "拿起笔记本电脑开始走动。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:58 bb8a4052cc214c8093769271ad247482
msgid "The Copter should follow you!"
msgstr "飞机将跟随您移动！"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:60 ed0bd2fa0c0945548297738d4e1ca349
msgid "Make sure to set sufficient altitude to prevent any injuries."
msgstr "请确保飞行高度足够，以防任何伤害。"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:61 21d70d6e4db14984b02c59133c7b4fc3
msgid ""
"If proper altitude is set, you can make it follow you and attempt to out run"
" it!"
msgstr "若设置了合适的高度，可以让它跟随您并尝试快跑甩开它！"

#: ../../source/docs/ac2_followme.rst:65 e29375144d4d4f65a2b4b7c3b49ec210
msgid ""
"The barometer is used in the altitude calculation meaning that it can drift "
"over time and impact rising terrain. Watch for obstacles and elevation "
"changes. The altitude maintaining behavior is similar to loiter mode."
msgstr "气压计用于高度计算，这意味着高度会随时间漂移，并受地形上升影响。请注意障碍物和地势变化，高度保持行为与 Loiter 模式类似。"
